# doug

--- Reviver_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_REVIVER_1_DESC
raw  When Doug revives an ally successfully, he will heal for <VALUE1>% of his max health.
now  When Doug revives an ally successfully, he will heal for 100% of his max health.
  VALUE1  100  -> 100

--- Reviver_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_REVIVER_2_DESC
raw  Snack Attack also heals Doug by <VALUE1>.
now  Snack Attack also heals Doug by 20.
  VALUE1  20  -> 480

--- Reviver_ulti | super | TID_REVIVER_ULTI_DESC
raw  A special spiced up hot dog for a target ally or Doug himself. When a buffed Brawler is defeated they will come back with <VALUE1>% health after a short delay.
now  A special spiced up hot dog for a target ally or Doug himself. When a buffed Brawler is defeated they will come back with <VALUE1>% health after a short delay.
  VALUE1  -  -> 100
